        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMGR44-ABN, Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Auburn Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Maguire Handleset with Auburn Knob is a traditionally styled front door lock well suited to almost any application. It is easy to install and will adjust to fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Auburn Knob is a single cylinder handleset. It features an oval silhouette and an egg-shaped knob--one of the most iconic door hardware pairings of all time. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Expressions Maguire Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-1/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMGR44-ABN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262434\"><b>Yale YMGR44-ABN Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Maguire Handleset with Auburn Knob",
                "description": "The Oval Maguire Handleset with Auburn Knob is a traditionally styled front door lock well suited to almost any application. It is easy to install and will adjust to fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Auburn Knob is a single cylinder handleset. It features an oval silhouette and an egg-shaped knob--one of the most iconic door hardware pairings of all time.",
